  </div>
  <p class="org-badge">
    {% if org.logo %}<img class="org-logo" src="{{ org.logo }}" alt="" width="56" height="56" onerror="this.remove()">{% endif %}
    <a class="org-name" href="{{ org.url }}">{{ org.name }}</a>
  </p>
  <div class="eyebrow" id="eyebrowPeriod">Year in Review</div>
  <h1>Every commit is a <em>seed.</em></h1>
  <p class="hero-sub"><span id="durationLabel">Twelve months</span> of {{ org.tagline }} at {{ org.name }}, told as it happened: something small, planted in spring, that would not stop growing.</p>
  <svg class="seed" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true">
    <path d="M32 54 V34" stroke="#3A6B4E" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    <path d="M32 38 C 24 34, 20 26, 22 18 C 30 20, 34 28, 32 38 Z" fill="#8FB878"/>
    <path d="M32 34 C 40 30, 44 22, 42 14 C 34 16, 30 24, 32 34 Z" fill="#5D8F5F"/>
    <ellipse cx="32" cy="56" rx="14" ry="3.5" fill="#6B4A32" opacity=".35"/>
  </svg>
  <div class="scroll-hint">Scroll or use Page Down to follow the story</div>
</header>

<main id="main">

<!-- ============ GROWTH TRACK ============ -->
<section class="growth-track" id="track" aria-labelledby="story-heading">
  <h2 id="story-heading" class="visually-hidden">The growth story</h2>
  <div class="tree-stage" id="stage">
    <div class="stage-caption" id="caption" aria-hidden="true">Spring · a sapling takes root</div>
    <svg id="treeSvg" viewBox="0 0 800 700" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMax meet" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <!-- sun (rises during Light chapter) -->
      <g id="sunGroup" opacity="0">
        <circle id="sunCore" cx="640" cy="180" r="42" fill="var(--sun)"/>
        <g id="sunRays" stroke="var(--sun)" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" opacity=".8"></g>
      </g>

      <!-- ground -->
      <path d="M0 648 Q 400 630 800 648 L 800 700 L 0 700 Z" fill="#AECBA8"/>
      <ellipse cx="400" cy="648" rx="150" ry="12" fill="#8FB878" opacity=".5"/>

      <!-- trunk & branches (drawn by scroll in full motion) -->
      <g id="wood" fill="none" stroke="var(--bark)" stroke-linecap="round">
        <path class="grow" data-start="0.00" data-end="0.30" stroke-width="26"
              d="M400 650 C 398 560, 404 470, 398 380 C 395 320, 400 280, 402 240"/>
        <path class="grow" data-start="0.16" data-end="0.42" stroke-width="13"
              d="M399 470 C 360 440, 320 420, 285 375"/>
        <path class="grow" data-start="0.20" data-end="0.46" stroke-width="13"
              d="M400 430 C 445 400, 490 385, 520 340"/>
        <path class="grow" data-start="0.30" data-end="0.56" stroke-width="9"
              d="M300 392 C 275 365, 255 335, 250 300"/>
        <path class="grow" data-start="0.34" data-end="0.60" stroke-width="9"
              d="M505 352 C 535 325, 555 295, 558 262"/>
        <path class="grow" data-start="0.38" data-end="0.62" stroke-width="10"
              d="M402 300 C 380 260, 360 235, 330 210"/>
        <path class="grow" data-start="0.42" data-end="0.66" stroke-width="10"
              d="M402 275 C 425 235, 450 210, 480 190"/>
        <path class="grow" data-start="0.46" data-end="0.70" stroke-width="8"
              d="M402 240 C 400 205, 398 180, 396 150"/>
      </g>

      <!-- canopy clusters (scale in) -->
      <g id="canopy"></g>
      <!-- blossoms (Love chapter) -->
      <g id="blossoms"></g>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <!-- chapter panels: normal flow by default, overlay the stage in full motion -->
  <div class="chapters">
    <div class="chapter">
      <div class="panel">
        <p class="tag">Chapter 1 · Roots</p>
        <h3 id="chapter-roots" tabindex="-1">It started small.</h3>
        <p>One trunk, a handful of maintainers, and a habit of shipping. Keep reading — every branch you see is earned.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="chapter right">
      <div class="panel">
        <p class="tag">Chapter 2 · Heat 🔥</p>
        <h3 id="chapter-heat" tabindex="-1">Heat means work.</h3>
        <p>Commits and committers are the pulse of a project — the raw effort that makes wood.</p>
        <div class="stat-row">
          <div class="stat"><b data-count data-key="heat.commits">—</b><span>commits</span></div>
          <div class="stat"><b data-count data-key="heat.committers">—</b><span>committers</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="chapter">
      <div class="panel">
        <p class="tag">Chapter 3 · Light ☀️</p>
        <h3 id="chapter-light" tabindex="-1">Light means visibility.</h3>
        <p>Watchers subscribe to every change; stars are bookmarks of belief. The canopy turns toward the sun.</p>
        <div class="stat-row">
          <div class="stat"><b data-count data-key="light.watchers">—</b><span>watchers</span></div>
          <div class="stat"><b data-count data-key="light.stars">—</b><span>stars</span></div>
