    </div>
    <div class="chapter right">
      <div class="panel">
        <p class="tag">Chapter 4 · Love 🌸</p>
        <h3 id="chapter-love" tabindex="-1">Love means culture.</h3>
        <p>Forks carry the project into new soil, and merged PRs bring it home again. This is where a tree blossoms.</p>
        <div class="stat-row">
          <div class="stat"><b data-count data-key="love.forks">—</b><span>forks</span></div>
          <div class="stat"><b data-count data-key="love.prsMerged">—</b><span>PRs merged</span></div>
